  "prefLabel": "Agr 1106.01 Inspection Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1106.01 Inspection Fee.\n\n(a) Under RSA 431:6, each person distributing commercial fertilizer shall pay an inspection fee of 20 cents per ton of fertilizer sold in New Hampshire, with a minimum fee of $5.\n\n(b) Such fee shall be payable at the time of filing the semi-annual tonnage report as specified in RSA 431:6.\n\nSource. #1769, eff 6-30-81; ss by #2408, eff 6-30-83; ss by #2889, eff 10-22-84, EXPIRED 10-22-90\n\nNew. #5436, eff 7-22-92, EXPIRED: 7-22-98\n\nNew. #7218, eff 3-29-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-08\n\nNew. #10464, eff 11-26-13, EXPIRED: 11-26-23\n\nNew. #13947, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24\n\nNew. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
